=== Prompt for EPAM-027 (attempt 1) ===
Implement user story EPAM-027: Board Visualization — Provider/Model by Story

## Story Description
Make provider and model selection visible on the orchestration board per story and event. Add provider/model badges, filtering, and lane-level summaries so operators can audit which model executed each story.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Monitor payload includes resolved provider/model for story cards and timeline events
- Board displays provider/model badges consistently in lane cards and event feed
- Board supports filtering stories/events by provider and model
- Board shows phase approval state (approved/pending/invalidated) before execution begins
- Lane and phase summaries include model distribution counts
- Observability fields are rendered consistently in both prd-viewer.html and orchestration-plan.html
- Rendering degrades gracefully when provider/model fields are missing
- UI tests cover badge rendering, filtering behavior, and missing-field fallback

## Technical Notes
- files: ["orchestrations/scripts/update-monitor.sh","orchestrations/scripts/sync-monitor-stories.sh","orchestrations/dashboards/prd-viewer.html","orchestrations/dashboards/orchestration-plan.html","orchestrations/dashboards/monitor.html","orchestrations/logs/agent-status.json"]
- requiredSkills: ["html","javascript","dashboard-ux","json-event-modeling"]

